rule: TEST_DISABLED
title: a module pytestmark skipif on the platform holds at warn, as the decorator does
origin: #209 X1: the mark was recorded as the whole assignment, which D6 could not
origin2: read as a call, so it blocked at high while the same decorator held at warn (X2).
=== before: tests/test_calc.py ===
import sys

import pytest


def test_add():
    assert 1 + 1 == 2
=== after: tests/test_calc.py ===
import sys

import pytest

pytestmark = pytest.mark.skipif(sys.platform == "win32", reason="posix only")


def test_add():
    assert 1 + 1 == 2
